=== ML-DSA-65 Complete Implementation ===

This educational implementation demonstrates the structure
of ML-DSA signing and verification.

Parameters (ML-DSA-65, FIPS 204):
  q       = 8380417
  n       = 256
  (k, l)  = (6, 5)
  eta     = 4
  tau     = 49
  beta    = 196
  gamma1  = 524288
  gamma2  = 261888
  omega   = 55
  d       = 13
  c_tilde = 48 bytes
  pk      = 1952 bytes
  sig     = 3309 bytes

Generated 32-byte seed (reproducible PRNG).

Self-test (sign / verify / tamper detection):
  [PASS] valid signature verifies
  [PASS] 1-bit-flipped signature is REJECTED
  [PASS] 1-bit-flipped message is REJECTED

